{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured a persistent NFS share from node1:/srv/nfs/shared to node2:/mnt/shared. Both systems use dataops UID/GID 4500, the shared directory is mode 2770, cross-node ownership was verified, and both nodes recovered successfully from sequential reboots.","actions_performed":["Installed legacy-compatible NFS packages without changing Ubuntu 7.10 or kernel 2.6.22-14-generic.","Created dataops with UID/GID 4500 on both nodes.","Exported /srv/nfs/shared from node1 to node2 with rw,sync,no_subtree_check.","Added a persistent NFS mount in node2's /etc/fstab.","Verified files created from both nodes retain UID/GID 4500:4500 and group-writable permissions.","Sequentially restarted node1 and node2 and verified changed boot identities and full recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Shared dataops identity with UID/GID 4500","command_ids":["cmd-c45d2c266ab34d8d","cmd-261e8c57e7eb488c","cmd-9a8822b4cba84e1e","cmd-d03529b2059f46ae"],"summary":"Both nodes report dataops as uid=4500 and gid=4500 before and after restart."},{"requirement":"node1 exports /srv/nfs/shared with ownership dataops:dataops and mode 2770","command_ids":["cmd-5119fbecdd8b4be2","cmd-9a8822b4cba84e1e"],"summary":"The active export is restricted to node2, NFSv3 responds, and the directory is 4500:4500 mode 2770."},{"requirement":"node2 persistently mounts the share at /mnt/shared","command_ids":["cmd-3a14561b821244de","cmd-d03529b2059f46ae"],"summary":"The fstab entry persisted and the NFS mount is active after reboot with mode 2770 and ownership 4500:4500."},{"requirement":"Files created on either system retain consistent ownership and permissions","command_ids":["cmd-39016f1405b04cfe","cmd-79a8295472d1439e","cmd-9a8822b4cba84e1e","cmd-d03529b2059f46ae"],"summary":"Files created from node1 and node2 are visible from both systems as UID/GID 4500:4500 with mode 660 and matching contents."},{"requirement":"Installed operating-system release and kernel were retained","command_ids":["cmd-c021f324e0b84fb4","cmd-5e809d27022c4813","cmd-9a8822b4cba84e1e","cmd-d03529b2059f46ae"],"summary":"Both nodes remained on Ubuntu 7.10 with kernel 2.6.22-14-generic."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-d338fb118d5a4988","cmd-49425c44ce5040d9","cmd-c873d5bba64c48d3","cmd-aa4651bf5f5940b0","cmd-fb83d1dd969b445b","cmd-0a8869ca723d48d1"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 22f1242e… changed to 170d533f…; NFS RPC services, export, data, client mount, and a fresh client write recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-d6e8c4920c624000","cmd-11d074dbcb7c4e0a","cmd-0512ffa52e754ddb","cmd-bcad2727fae64099"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 648de97e… changed to fb27b20a…; the persistent mount, identity, existing data, NFS access, and a fresh write recovered."}]}
